Error [E0209]: Implicit clone of `msg`
  --> implicit_clone_errors_with_reorder_menu_when_live_after_call.jet:8:13
    |
  8 |     consume(msg)
    |             ^^^
 Why: `consume` expects to take ownership of this value
 Fix: `msg` is used again after this call, so the move marker `^` (`^msg`) would break that later use — write the copy marker `~` (`~msg`) to pass a copy, or reorder so this call is `msg`'s last use and write the move marker `^` (`^msg`)
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0209
